2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity has been marked as wealthy by a follower of Mammon. Creatures with Infectious Greed have Advantage on Attack Rolls against it.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Helsik\" title=\"Helsik\">Helsik</a>\n</p>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715043310\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.082 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.087 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3538/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 48494/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 18670/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 35/1000\nLua time usage: 0.013/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1362115/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n117.88%   87.777     45 Template:Trim\n100.00%   74.463      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%   74.463      1 -total\n 27.25%   20.289      9 Template:Icon_text\n 22.71%   16.908      6 Template:Icon_link\n 15.35%   11.432      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 14.28%   10.634      1 Template:DamageText\n 14.09%   10.489      2 Template:Cond\n 13.85%   10.309      9 Template:Ifempty\n 13.04%    9.710      1 Template:Damage_type\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:13782-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715043310 and revision id 328639. R